   <h2 id="s1-h">What IronClaude is</h2>
   <p class="lead">IronClaude is a set of lessons learned about using AI well, wrapped into skills, so that long runs give reliable, repeatable output.</p>
   <div class="term"><b>Skill:</b> a packaged set of instructions Claude loads for one kind of work, such as planning, debugging or review. You start most of them with a slash command, for example <code>/sc:workflow</code>.</div>
