+  <p>The routing guide, <code>HOW-WE-WORK.md</code>, tells you which skill or command to use for each kind of work, and in what order. <code>superclaude install</code> copies it to <code>~/.claude/HOW-WE-WORK.md</code>. Keep it open while you work: this deck explains the <em>why</em>, and the guide holds the exact commands and flags. The one exception is <code>--plugin</code> on slide 8, which comes from the <code>/sc:recommend</code> command file.</p>
   <p class="story">As it was put in the onboarding meeting: think of the skills as the basic instructions an AI needs to give reliable, repeatable output over a long run.</p>
